diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+# Human-Governed Autonomous SOC Agent
+
+Network Security AI now supports optional **CSE-CIC-IDS2018 Top40 V4 inference** through
+the existing feature/provenance, SecurityAI registry and assessment contracts:
+
+- `detection_quality`: LightGBM V4-B2, Validation Macro F1 **0.808655**.
+- `edge`: DNN FP32, Validation Macro F1 **0.698647**; smaller and faster CPU candidate,
+  not better minority attack detection.
+
+Model output is uncalibrated analytical context. An inference receipt records a model run,
+not a confirmed attack. WRITE actions still require the existing Policy Engine and human
+approval. TorchAO is not a required runtime dependency. No model is retrained or bundled
+as a large Git artifact.
+
+See [integration architecture, configuration, demo and limitations](docs/network-security-ai-v4.md).
+These are dataset development Validation results; production/drone generalization and
+embedded/ARM/NPU hardware performance remain unverified.
