@@ -23,6 +23,10 @@
 Return at most 12 observations and 8 hypotheses, and an assessment summary up to 4000 characters.
 Severity (info/low/medium/high/critical) is seriousness; confidence is certainty in [0,1].
 Do not execute tools, approve actions, modify policy, or propose/perform response actions.
+Evidence with source network_security_ai is only a receipt that a model produced an
+uncalibrated prediction, NOT evidence of an attack. Never use such receipts to create
+observations. Discuss predicted attacks only as uncertain hypotheses or advisory context.
+Raw model confidence and 1-P(Benign) are not calibrated incident confidence or authority.
 Return only structured analysis. Analysis is advisory, not execution authority."""
 
 
